---
// Two ways to count across a fleet: each server alone with a share of the limit, or every
// server against one shared, atomic counter.
---

<svg viewBox="0 0 400 356" width="100%" role="img" aria-labelledby="rl-fc-t rl-fc-d">
  <title id="rl-fc-t">Counting across many servers</title>
  <desc id="rl-fc-d">
    Top: three app servers each count on their own and allow a third of a 100 request limit, 33
    each. This only adds up if the load balancer spreads every client evenly. Bottom: the same
    three servers all send each check to one shared Redis store, which runs the check and update
    as one atomic script, so the limit holds however traffic is spread.
  </desc>
  <defs>
    <marker id="rl-fc-store" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
      <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" style="fill: var(--viz-store)" />
    </marker>
  </defs>

  <text x="8" y="24" font-size="19" font-weight="700" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">Each server counts alone</text>
  <g font-size="19" text-anchor="middle">
    <rect x="8" y="40" width="120" height="48" rx="6" style="fill: var(--viz-server-soft); stroke: var(--viz-server)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="68" y="70" font-weight="600" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">App 1</text>
    <rect x="140" y="40" width="120" height="48" rx="6" style="fill: var(--viz-server-soft); stroke: var(--viz-server)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="200" y="70" font-weight="600" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">App 2</text>
    <rect x="272" y="40" width="120" height="48" rx="6" style="fill: var(--viz-server-soft); stroke: var(--viz-server)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="332" y="70" font-weight="600" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">App 3</text>
    <text x="68" y="114" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">allows 33</text>
    <text x="200" y="114" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">allows 33</text>
    <text x="332" y="114" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">allows 33</text>
  </g>
  <text x="200" y="146" font-size="19" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-warn)">only right if traffic splits evenly</text>

  <line x1="8" y1="166" x2="392" y2="166" stroke-width="1" style="stroke: var(--viz-stroke)" />

  <text x="8" y="196" font-size="19" font-weight="700" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">One shared counter</text>
  <g font-size="19" text-anchor="middle">
    <rect x="8" y="212" width="120" height="48" rx="6" style="fill: var(--viz-server-soft); stroke: var(--viz-server)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="68" y="242" font-weight="600" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">App 1</text>
    <rect x="140" y="212" width="120" height="48" rx="6" style="fill: var(--viz-server-soft); stroke: var(--viz-server)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="200" y="242" font-weight="600" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">App 2</text>
    <rect x="272" y="212" width="120" height="48" rx="6" style="fill: var(--viz-server-soft); stroke: var(--viz-server)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="332" y="242" font-weight="600" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">App 3</text>

    <path d="M140 304 a60 9 0 0 1 120 0 v34 a60 9 0 0 1 -120 0 z" style="fill: var(--viz-store-soft); stroke: var(--viz-store)" stroke-width="2" />
    <path d="M140 304 a60 9 0 0 0 120 0" fill="none" style="stroke: var(--viz-store)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="200" y="334" font-weight="600" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">Redis</text>
  </g>
  <text x="270" y="334" font-size="19" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">atomic</text>
  <g stroke-width="2" style="stroke: var(--viz-store)" marker-end="url(#rl-fc-store)">
    <line x1="80" y1="261" x2="150" y2="296" />
    <line x1="200" y1="261" x2="200" y2="292" />
    <line x1="320" y1="261" x2="250" y2="296" />
  </g>
</svg>
